92
00:06:54,935 --> 00:07:01,619
One should not descend, whether on his

93
00:06:58,555 --> 00:07:03,869
knees or his hands, unless he is

94
00:07:01,619 --> 00:07:07,269
composed.

95
00:07:03,869 --> 00:07:10,581
He says: "Then he would say takbir and

96
00:07:07,269 --> 00:07:13,894
descend into prostration, placing his

97
00:07:10,581 --> 00:07:16,684
