112
00:07:58,375 --> 00:08:02,384
Not here, these are the tips of the toes

113
00:08:00,949 --> 00:08:05,141
.

114
00:08:02,384 --> 00:08:06,550
And not here, this is the back of the

115
00:08:05,141 --> 00:08:09,403
